    {
      "type": "Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions",
      "notes": "Suggested Use: As a dietary supplement take two (2) capsules once a day. For best results take 20-30 min before a meal with an 8oz. glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "Caution: Do not exceed recommended dose."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "This product is not intended for pregnant or nursing mothers, children under the age of 18, or individuals taking prescription drugs."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Children",
      "notes": "This product is not intended for pregnant or nursing mothers, children under the age of 18, or individuals taking prescription drugs."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: All Other",
      "notes": "Discontinue use immediately if nausea, sleeplessness, or nervousness occur."
    },
    {
      "type": "Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications",
      "notes": "Do not take this product if you have a known medical condition including high blood pressure, diabetes, any cardiovascular disorder, heart disease, hyperthyroidism, or are taking anti-depressant medications."
    },
    {
      "type": "General Statements: All Other Content",
      "notes": "If you have questions about the advisability of taking this product, consult your physician prior to use.\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Arazo AlphaMAXX's proprietary blend enhances sexual pleasure and boosts erectile function by improving blood flow and hormone balance. Apart from increasing the sexual health of men, our unique blend of herbs and Ginseng also improves the mood and boosts endurance."
